WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.700
The box takes more than a description.

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.800
These options sit under the box, closed by default.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.900
They were kept shut until the plain path was clear.

4
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.800
Competitors can be named directly.

5
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.600
It skips working out the market and reads them.

6
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.300
A website address works too.

7
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:26.800
It reads that company first, then looks for similar ones.

8
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.300
Both can go in one sentence.

9
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:32.300
The report is the same in each case.
